  "\"窗口管理：仅 Linux X11（走 wmctrl），本机没有\" = \"Window control: Linux X11 only (wmctrl), not available here\"\n" +
  "\"激活窗口：仅 Linux X11（走 wmctrl）\" = \"Activate window: Linux X11 only (wmctrl)\"\n" +
  "\"没有可激活的窗口\" = \"No window to activate\"\n" +
