  "\"组回退：下面一组的 cursor = ResizeH；组内文本没提请求 → 用组的形状，按钮自己请求了手型 → 以它为准。\" = \"Group fallback: the group below asks for ResizeH; the text inside makes no request so it takes the group's shape, while the button's own hand cursor wins.\"\n" +
